# Generated run artifacts. Anchored negation below: the console's /runs route is
# source, and a bare `runs/` silently swallowed it (git will not descend into an
# ignored directory, so the directory itself must be re-included, not just its files).
runs/
!apps/web/app/(console)/runs/
